  "about": "Exhibit B 'Sample PBC List' from Buncombe County, North Carolina's January 2023 audit RFP (pages 11-15 of the RFP, copied unchanged with pdf-lib; the rest of the RFP is proposal instructions). 171 short item titles under upper-case section headings, no numbers or refs, so refs are PBC-01.. in order. No year appears anywhere in these pages ('for FY', 'at June 30'), so every period is null: a parser should not invent one. No dollar thresholds. Ramp-answerable, both judgment calls: 'Listing - Payment Numbers for FY' and 'Listing - Checks (Various)' are disbursement listings, scored bill_support (they come from the county's Workday ERP; Ramp holds them only for bills paid through Ramp). 'P-Card Fund Accrual' is an accrual, 'Purchase Orders Issued During FY' and 'PO Date and Invoice Date Comparison Report' are purchasing reports Tickmark has no type for: all unsupported. One title wraps onto a second line ('... Copy of JV and Supporting / Info').",
